The two switches have identical four-case sets. The register writer preserves all four format bits, so the drawing path permits 16 encodings and leaves 12 unhandled. I’m checking the other callers and the file’s unsupported-case idioms; the restriction to three files limits Q4’s tree-wide usage claim.

